      "content": "those are okay, but they're a bit surface level. i want to get a bit more \"edgy\" with it for a late night set. like, what are some of the more \"uncomfortable\" or darker tropes people make jokes about? like when it comes to crime, or how they act in certain neighborhoods, or even just the way they treat other groups? i want to know where the actual \"edge\" is so i can decide if i want to go there or avoid it.",
